01:00.760 --> 01:04.576
989 Langs Drive in Cambridge, An update on the consumption

01:04.608 --> 01:08.144
and treatment services, the HART Hub, And we'll be hearing

01:08.192 --> 01:11.504
a presentation from Paramedic Services on their annual

01:11.552 --> 01:15.328
key performance measures indicators and responses for

01:15.384 --> 01:18.624
2 24. To begin, I'd like to invite

01:18.672 --> 01:22.060
