59:35.274 --> 59:38.962
working at the CTS to ensure wherever possible that

59:38.986 --> 59:43.310
we, you know, have opportunities that people can avail themselves of.

59:43.770 --> 59:44.830
Thank you. Councillor Huinink.

59:48.680 --> 59:52.100
Thank you, Chair, and thank you for this excellent presentation.

59:52.440 --> 59:56.016
I think it's really interesting and innovative that we are not

59:56.168 --> 59:59.504
locating the HART hub in a specific location and that we

59:59.512 --> 01:00:03.056
