01:00:03.088 --> 01:00:05.780
with service. I think that's really awesome.

01:00:06.280 --> 01:00:09.900
Is that the model that is also being followed by

01:00:10.520 --> 01:00:13.790
other locations that have a HART hub that we know of?

01:00:13.840 --> 01:00:14.550


01:00:18.330 --> 01:00:21.666
we're really fortunate and thank you, So sorry, Through you, the chair,

01:00:21.818 --> 01:00:25.522
thank you so much for, for your comment as well. We're, we're excited about it

01:00:25.546 --> 01:00:28.962
