01:00:50.516 --> 01:00:53.836
There are communities that are partnering with one or two

01:00:53.988 --> 01:00:57.932
different partners and then there's communities like ours who have

01:00:58.116 --> 01:01:01.756
more partners, upwards of five funded partners and then

01:01:01.908 --> 01:01:05.612
20 plus other partners in the community. Great. In my

01:01:05.636 --> 01:01:09.258
