01:03:07.888 --> 01:03:11.632
that went along with this. So just wondering what's happening

01:03:11.696 --> 01:03:12.860
on that front.

01:03:16.040 --> 01:03:19.552
Through you the chair, Thank you for that question. That was the piece that I was

01:03:19.576 --> 01:03:24.362
