01:03:31.122 --> 01:03:34.634
the 12 transitional housing beds. So that new transitional housing

01:03:34.682 --> 01:03:38.522
program and then in addition to that will be some rent supplements

01:03:38.586 --> 01:03:42.842
to allow people to move into permanent housing more affordably.

01:03:42.986 --> 01:03:46.122
Okay. Is that anywhere near the, going

01:03:46.146 --> 01:03:49.610
to meet the need we have, do you think, in this, like in this,

01:03:49.650 --> 01:03:52.826
in our region? to meet the need? No.

01:03:52.898 --> 01:03:56.570
There's many people on the, on a wait list

01:03:56.610 --> 01:03:59.510
for supportive housing and for affordable housing. You're right.

01:03:59.890 --> 01:04:04.234
It's a, this program is a targeted program to provide support

01:04:04.402 --> 01:04:08.010
and stability to ensure successful housing after,

01:04:08.130 --> 01:04:11.482
so, And we would have loved 100 beds, but what

01:04:11.506 --> 01:04:15.500
