01:04:15.540 --> 01:04:19.052
them to be successful in housing after. So 6 to 12 months is

01:04:19.076 --> 01:04:22.012
how long we're hoping people can be in the program and we would like to

01:04:22.036 --> 01:04:25.772
see movement out of the program so we can support more folks in. Okay.

01:04:25.836 --> 01:04:29.532
Really it's about a health approach to ensuring housing stability.

01:04:29.676 --> 01:04:33.520
Okay. And you're going to continue to come back and provide updates?

01:04:33.860 --> 01:04:37.404
I don't know if that's something we're going to request

01:04:37.452 --> 01:04:39.720
