01:04:44.586 --> 01:04:48.242
that because it's good information, I think for us to know. Yeah. And through you,

01:04:48.266 --> 01:04:51.202
the chair, yes, we would love to provide updates and what we're trying to

01:04:51.226 --> 01:04:54.482
do here specifically with House of Friendship is learn a little bit

01:04:54.506 --> 01:04:57.954
more about this model of housing as we grow into Friendship Village

01:04:58.002 --> 01:05:01.570
and as we grow House of Friendship supportive and affordable housing

01:05:01.650 --> 01:05:04.430
portfolio. Thank you very much,

01:05:05.980 --> 01:05:09.716
Councillor Wolf. Through you,

01:05:09.868 --> 01:05:13.748
Mr. Chair, Again, thank you for your report and

01:05:13.884 --> 01:05:16.160
