01:16:24.786 --> 01:16:28.618
working with community partners to see what

01:16:28.674 --> 01:16:32.510
they're seeing as well, and looking at evaluating the transition

01:16:33.010 --> 01:16:37.030
and opening of the HART Hub and what clients are accessing those services.

01:16:37.420 --> 01:16:39.400
And I'll pass it over to Tara.

01:16:41.580 --> 01:16:45.280
Yeah. Through you, the chair, Thank you, Chair Redman, for your question.

01:16:45.740 --> 01:16:49.764
We, as you know, we'll get the traditional monitoring through the, Through the funding

01:16:49.812 --> 01:16:52.920
letter. We have not yet got all of those pieces.

01:16:53.820 --> 01:16:57.108
And then we have been told that there will be a dedicated team

01:16:57.164 --> 01:17:00.548
