01:17:26.022 --> 01:17:29.272
I understand what you're asking. I think you're asking if HART Hub will

01:17:29.296 --> 01:17:34.072
be a pathway for individuals seeking rehabilitation,

01:17:34.136 --> 01:17:37.100
addiction recovery formally. Is that Correct?

01:17:37.600 --> 01:17:41.304
Who voluntarily would seek it now, but the services, they're on

01:17:41.312 --> 01:17:44.424
a wait list. Yeah, no, great question. Yes,

01:17:44.472 --> 01:17:47.380
absolutely. And I think, you know, as we know,

01:17:48.080 --> 01:17:51.816
change orientation is important to successful rehabilitation,

01:17:52.008 --> 01:17:55.590
even for folks who are change oriented. It can take up to seven,

01:17:55.710 --> 01:17:59.270
you know, times through a rehab program to be successful. So that

01:17:59.310 --> 01:18:03.174
change orientation is important, whatever it may be and at whatever stage

01:18:03.222 --> 01:18:07.078
it may be at. And what we heard was that

01:18:07.134 --> 01:18:10.518
often the barrier to folks accessing the services, and I think someone

01:18:10.574 --> 01:18:13.686
here spoke about it, is that when folks are ready

01:18:13.718 --> 01:18:17.510
for change, there needs to be services available. And that's sort

01:18:18.010 --> 01:18:21.436
of what we're really endeavoring to have the HART Hub do

01:18:21.588 --> 01:18:24.972
through, you know, through all those different pathways, through the teams that

01:18:24.996 --> 01:18:28.236
are currently embedded in the community and then through a process

01:18:28.308 --> 01:18:31.692
that links someone to a coordinator that stays with them throughout

01:18:31.756 --> 01:18:35.452
and gets them through each stage of that change to

01:18:35.476 --> 01:18:39.100
make them as successful as they possibly can be in

01:18:39.140 --> 01:18:41.440
their self determined journey.

01:18:42.580 --> 01:18:45.308
If I could just say thank you very much for all the work you're doing

01:18:45.364 --> 01:18:49.132
and again, I am just so proud of our community partners and

01:18:49.156 --> 01:18:53.260
the fact this is a systems response that will be available right

01:18:53.300 --> 01:18:56.844
across the region to everyone who needs to avail themselves of it. So thank you

01:18:56.852 --> 01:18:57.880
for the great work.

