01:25:46.862 --> 01:25:50.322
you know, unpack for us in terms of, of the

01:25:50.346 --> 01:25:54.722
HART hubs. My concern remains with the fact that

01:25:54.826 --> 01:25:58.610
when you look at the recovery

01:25:58.770 --> 01:26:02.402
statistics for people who have addictions and

01:26:02.426 --> 01:26:06.194
if you look at the number of mental health issues we have, and if

01:26:06.202 --> 01:26:10.146
you look at the number of people accessing drug paraphernalia

01:26:10.178 --> 01:26:13.954
or using drugs daily, the down payment that we're making

01:26:14.042 --> 01:26:18.002
