01:26:21.722 --> 01:26:25.390
I have and I think that's what we have to start looking at.

01:26:25.690 --> 01:26:29.714
What is the issue here in terms of overall needs and

01:26:29.802 --> 01:26:32.962
what else should we be asking for? Because I

01:26:32.986 --> 01:26:36.274
don't want the public to walk away today thinking this is

01:26:36.362 --> 01:26:39.762
going to solve the issue. It's only a tiny part

01:26:39.866 --> 01:26:43.586
of solving the issue. I do thank again, the presenters,

01:26:43.618 --> 01:26:47.570
thank you. Thank you.

01:26:48.590 --> 01:26:51.990
Thanks for the presentation. Thanks for all the

01:26:52.030 --> 01:26:55.878
work you're doing in such a short period of time to create

01:26:55.934 --> 01:26:59.350
this new program for us. Thank you. So we

