02:02:38.536 --> 02:02:41.904
separate requirement, legislative requirement. And by the end of

02:02:41.912 --> 02:02:45.616
the month, I have to submit that response time performance Plan results

02:02:45.688 --> 02:02:48.864
for 2024 to the province as per the Ambulance Act, which is why I'm here

02:02:48.872 --> 02:02:51.660
