02:03:07.540 --> 02:03:11.372
It goes without saying that those improvements can't happen without the

02:03:11.396 --> 02:03:14.748
hard work of the paramedics and logistics staff that work for region of Waterloo

02:03:14.764 --> 02:03:18.668
