02:03:18.724 --> 02:03:22.780
support from areas like IT Services, legal, HR and

02:03:22.820 --> 02:03:26.012
finance to make sure we can deliver really great programs. So we're thankful

02:03:26.076 --> 02:03:29.922
to them. I would also like to acknowledge the presentation

02:03:29.986 --> 02:03:33.330
done prior to the lunch break about the HART Hub. The HART

02:03:33.370 --> 02:03:36.770
