02:03:43.882 --> 02:03:47.634
And so a successful HART hub, hopefully in

02:03:47.642 --> 02:03:51.378
the future will allow us to create alternative care

02:03:51.434 --> 02:03:55.006
pathways, which means we can reduce demand on emergencies departments.

02:03:55.118 --> 02:03:58.542
Because right now if someone, if the HART hub was open today and

02:03:58.566 --> 02:04:02.190
